  "_how_to_extend": [
    "concept_words: business vocabulary a deck is written in. Most are keys of assets/icons/CONCEPTS.json; add a concept there first, then the word here.",
    "keyword_words: plain nouns that must be found through INDEX.json keywords, NOT through the concept map. Checked with search(), which bypasses concepts. This list is the guard against a stemmer that drops literal matches.",
