    "At least 20 words in total must NOT be concept keys, otherwise the gate only asserts that a dictionary contains its own keys and cannot catch keyword regressions. selftest.py enforces this.",
    "Adding a word that does not resolve is a legitimate way to report a gap: the self-test will fail and name it."
